        <Text>
          <style>Title</style>
          <text>Audio v0.10 - LV landing across a repeat</text>
        </Text>
        <Text>
          <style>Subtitle</style>
          <size>10</size>
          <text>Modern FluidSynth. The first C attacks normally. The C before the repeat ties into the returning first measure.
The return must have no extra attack, and its LV must sustain that chain. Overlapping holds share one release.
Listen through the repeat, stop/seek during the hold, and compare WAV/MIDI export.</text>
        </Text>
      </VBox>
